#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:2
msgid "Using poethepoet with AI Agents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:4
msgid ""
"Poe the Poet is a good fit with agentic coding workflows, as a way to "
"standardize allowed agent actions within a project. This page collects some "
"tips to help get the most from poethepoet when working with coding agents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:8
msgid ""
"Add a section to your CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md to instruct the agent to always "
"check for and use available poe tasks when performing common actions like "
"testing, linting, formatting, or whatever is relevant for your project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:10
msgid ""
"This helps the agent avoid running with incorrect configuration or "
"dependencies, and makes it easier to manage permissions for these actions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:13
msgid "Agent Skill"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:15
msgid ""
"The official poethepoet skill can help your AI Agent use poethepoet more "
"effectively. It covers discovering and executing tasks, as well as more in-"
"depth guidance on creating them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:17
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`full installation instructions<Install the poethepoet AI Agent "
"skill>`, or simply run the interactive installer with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:19
msgid "poe _install_skill"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:25
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:27
msgid ""
"Include the following in your ``.claude/settings.json`` to grant your agent "
"permission to run any poe task, assuming you only define poe tasks for "
"benign actions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:29
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"permissions\": {\n"
"    \"allow\": [\n"
"      \"Bash(poe *)\"\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:39
msgid ""
"If you have a lightweight poe task for code formatting, then you might want "
"to configure your agent to run that task whenever it finishes making changes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/ai_agents_guide.rst:41
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"hooks\": {\n"
"    \"Stop\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"hooks\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"type\": \"command\",\n"
"            \"command\": \"poe format\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
